{"unit_id":"tag:03NG:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是一个范畴（category）。一个 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>目标固定的态射族（family of morphisms with fixed target）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0002> 是如下数据：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 一个对象（object）<MATH_0003>，\n<STRUCT_0003> 一个集合（set）<MATH_0004>（可以是空（empty）的），以及\n<STRUCT_0004> 对所有 <MATH_0005>，给定态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，它属于 <MATH_0007>，目标为 <MATH_0008>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms with fixed target","target_term":"目标固定的态射族"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms with fixed target","target_term":"目标固定的态射族","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03NF:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n存在 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>目标固定的态射族（families of morphisms）之间的态射（morphism）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>这一概念。其特殊情形是 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>加细（refinement）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的概念。这些材料的参考资料是位点（Sites）第 <REF_0001> 节。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"目标固定的态射族"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"目标固定的态射族","context":"原文有 with fixed target 限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03NH:statement","translation":"一个 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>位点（site）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>我们所称的位点（site），在 <REF_0001> 中称为配备预拓扑（pretopology）的范畴（category）。\n在 <REF_0002> 中，它称为带有 Grothendieck 拓扑（topology）的范畴（category）。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>由一个范畴（category）<MATH_0001> 和一个集合（set）<MATH_0002> 组成，后者由目标固定的态射族（families of morphisms）组成，称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>覆盖（coverings）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，满足\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> （同构（isomorphism））如果 <MATH_0003> 是 <MATH_0004> 中的同构（isomorphism），则 <MATH_0005> 是覆盖（covering）；\n<STRUCT_0003> （局部性（locality））如果 <MATH_0006> 是覆盖（covering），且对所有 <MATH_0007> 都给定覆盖（covering）<MATH_0008>，则\n<MATH_0009>\n也是覆盖（covering）；并且\n<STRUCT_0004> （基变换（base change））如果 <MATH_0010> 是覆盖（covering），且 <MATH_0011> 是 <MATH_0012> 中的态射（morphism），则\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006> 对所有 <MATH_0013>，纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0014> 在 <MATH_0015> 中存在，且\n<STRUCT_0007> <MATH_0016> 是覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009>\n","allowed_english":["Grothendieck"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"pretopology","target_term":"预拓扑"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"目标固定的态射族"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"locality","target_term":"局部性"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"pretopology","target_term":"预拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"目标固定的态射族","context":"原文 with fixed target 限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"locality","target_term":"局部性","context":"公理名称，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03NF:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对我们而言，位点（site）的底层范畴（category）总是“小（small）的”，即其对象（objects）的全体构成集合（set），而位点（site）的覆盖（coverings）的全体也构成集合（set）（如上述定义中所述）。本章中，我们大多会省略把对象（objects）和覆盖（coverings）的全体缩减为集合（set）的论证。进一步的讨论见位点（Sites）备注 <REF_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"underlying 的限定保留，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03NI:statement","translation":"如果 <MATH_0001> 是拓扑空间（topological space），则它有一个相关的位点（site）<MATH_0002>，定义如下：<MATH_0003> 的对象（objects）是 <MATH_0004> 的开子集（open subsets），它们之间的态射（morphisms）是包含（inclusion）映射（mappings），覆盖（coverings）是通常的拓扑（topological）（满射（surjective））覆盖（coverings）。注意，如果 <MATH_0005> 是开子集（open subsets），则 <MATH_0006> 存在：这个范畴（category）具有纤维积（fiber products）。所有验证都是平凡的，一切都如预期那样成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"open subsets","target_term":"开子集"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"mappings","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"open subsets","target_term":"开子集"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fiber products","target_term":"纤维积"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"open subsets","target_term":"开子集","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"mappings","target_term":"映射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topological","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"fiber products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
