{"unit_id":"tag:03NK:statement","translation":"一个预层（presheaf）<MATH_0001>，其值为集合（sets）（分别为阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaf）），在位点（site）<MATH_0002> 上称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>分离预层（separated presheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对所有覆盖（coverings）\n<MATH_0003>\n映射（map）\n<MATH_0004>\n都是单射（injective）。这里的映射（map）是 <MATH_0005>。\n预层（presheaf）<MATH_0006> 是 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>层（sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对所有覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0007>，图（diagram）\n<MATH_0008>\n（其中第一个映射（map）是 <MATH_0009>，右边的两个映射（maps）是 <MATH_0010> 和 <MATH_0011>）是等化子（equalizer）图（diagram），所在范畴（category）是集合（sets）（分别为<SPACE_0001>阿贝尔群（abelian groups））构成的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"separated presheaf","target_term":"分离预层"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"separated presheaf","target_term":"分离预层","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_te