{"unit_id":"tag:03NM:statement","translation":"对空（empty）覆盖（covering）（其中 <MATH_0001>），这意味着 <MATH_0002> 是空（empty）积（product），即相应范畴（category）中的终对象（final object）（对 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 都是单点集（singleton））。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单点集"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单点集","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03NN:statement","translation":"对与拓扑空间（topological space）相关的位点（site）<MATH_0001>（见例 <REF_0001>）具体展开这一定义，就得到层（sheaves）的通常概念。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
